{"route":{"id":"17451","name":"Ruta dels Masos","intro":"Interessant i atractiva proposta de ruta familiar que ens acompanyarà a conèixer alguns dels <strong>masos fortificats més emblemàtics de l’Escala, com ara el Mas de Vilanera, Can Reding o Can Jepot.</strong> Altres atractius destacats d’aquesta ruta són els camps de conreu <strong>d’arbres fruiters, els recs i la vegetació de ribera</strong> que els acompanya, i <strong>el Pi Gros</strong>, impressionant exemplar de pi pinyer.","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Familiar","durada":"1 hora 33 minuts","desnivell":"6.00 meters","distancia":"5.40 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Medi i arquitectura","imgs":["n17451_1.jpg","n17451_2.jpg","n17451_3.jpg","n17451_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-parc-natural-del-montgri-illes-medes-i-baix-ter/ruta-dels-masos","track":[[42.10906,3.12697],[42.10906,3.12697],[42.10897,3.12694],[42.10887,3.12695],[42.10876,3.12691],[42.10867,3.12687],[42.10861,3.12677],[42.1086,3.12663],[42.1086,3.12649],[42.10858,3.12635],[42.10858,3.12625],[42.10857,3.12612],[42.10854,3.12601],[42.10852,3.12588],[42.10848,3.12575],[42.10847,3.12562],[42.10844,3.12549],[42.10844,3.12534],[42.10842,3.12519],[42.10842,3.12504],[42.1084,3.12492],[42.10839,3.12479],[42.10838,3.12466],[42.10835,3.12453],[42.10831,3.1244],[42.10826,3.12426],[42.10824,3.1241],[42.10822,3.12396],[42.10823,3.12387],[42.10821,3.12374],[42.10819,3.12359],[42.10817,3.12345],[42.10815,3.12329],[42.10811,3.12314],[42.1081,3.12299],[42.10807,3.12287],[42.10804,3.12275],[42.10805,3.12262],[42.10801,3.12248],[42.10798,3.12233],[42.10796,3.12218],[42.10793,3.12203],[42.10791,3.12189],[42.10789,3.12171],[42.1079,3.12156],[42.10792,3.1214],[42.10793,3.12123],[42.10793,3.12108],[42.10792,3.12093],[42.1079,3.12078],[42.10792,3.12066],[42.10793,3.12052],[42.10792,3.1204],[42.10794,3.12028],[42.10792,3.12014],[42.10794,3.11997],[42.10797,3.11983],[42.10798,3.11966],[42